ps://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3759220/extras/AboutTheGame6.gif?t=1753195726\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 Get to know the charming residents of Pebble Town, each with their own stories, quirks, and secrets. Strengthen your bonds through heartfelt conversations and meaningful interactions.    <br>    <br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3759220/extras/INGAMEGIF_04.gif?t=1753195726\" /></div></p>","developers":["Pixel Puffs"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3759220/2f718e1afda29098eca634c3f3df22ac7bef81d9/header.jpg?t=1753195726","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"<strong>Copyright \u00a9 2025 | Pixel Puffs</strong>","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Mac OSX 10.10+<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2 Ghz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> 256 mb video memory, OpenGL 2<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Mac OSX 10.10+<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2 Ghz<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> 256 mb video memory, OpenGL 2<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 MB available space</li></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257142374,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257142374/movie480.mp4?t=1748415929","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257142374/movie_max.mp4?t=1748415929"},"name":"Gameplay Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_it